.claude
.DS_Store

# Example pages are generated from examples/*/run.jl by Literate (docs/make.jl)
docs/src/examples/
docs/src/validation/

docs/src/demos/

# `docs/src/.vitepress/` and `docs/src/components/` are NOT generated: they hold the
# VitePress config and theme, and are tracked. Only the four files that differ from
# DocumenterVitepress's own templates live there — everything else it substitutes in.

